{'symbol': 'PEAK', 'date': '2023-02-10 16:06:00', 'title': 'HEALTHPEAK ANNOUNCES CLOSING OF HOLDING COMPANY REORGANIZATION', 'text': 'DENVER , FEB. 10, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HEALTHPEAK PROPERTIES, INC. (NYSE: PEAK) (THE "COMPANY") TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF ITS HOLDING COMPANY REORGANIZATION (THE "REORGANIZATION"), WHICH RESTRUCTURED THE COMPANY AS AN UMBRELLA PARTNERSHIP REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUST, OR UPREIT. THE REORGANIZATION PROVIDES ADDITIONAL FLEXIBILITY FOR THE COMPANY TO EFFICIENTLY ACQUIRE PROPERTIES IN A TAX-DEFERRED MANNER AND ALIGNS THE COMPANY\'S CORPORATE STRUCTURE WITH OTHER PUBLICLY TRADED U.S. REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUSTS.'}